{"id":"escenario","lemma":"escenario","pos":"noun","rank":1221,"glosses":["scenario","scene, setting","stage"],"ipa":"/esθeˈnaɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"escenarios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-escenario.wav","examples":[{"text":"Considera el siguiente escenario.","en":"Consider the following scenario.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804314"},{"text":"Ese escenario es poco probable.","en":"That scenario is unlikely.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804313"},{"text":"El escenario era indescriptiblemente bello.","en":"The scenery was beautiful beyond description.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692665"},{"text":"¿Cuál es el peor escenario posible?","en":"What's the worst-case scenario?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804315"},{"text":"Tomás salió del escenario.","en":"Tom walked out on stage."}]}